# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THIRD-PARTY ASSET PACKS. This repo is PUBLIC.
#
# Anything bought or licensed from the Asset Store must NOT be committed --
# publishing pack contents is redistribution and the EULAs forbid it. Our own
# work lives under Assets/_Project. Bought packs go at the top level of
# Assets/ and get a rule added HERE, on the day they are imported.
#
# Rule of thumb: if you did not make it and it is not CC0, it does not go up.
# Record each pack in Docs/ASSETS.md so a fresh clone knows what to reimport.
#
# Add new packs below this line:
# /Assets/<PackName>/
# /Assets/<PackName>.meta
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- packs imported 2026-09-20. Paid/licensed: must never reach a public repo.
/Assets/Low Poly Guns/
/Assets/Low Poly Guns.meta
/Assets/Vefects/
/Assets/Vefects.meta
